@startuml 申請審核作業
title 使用案例2: 申請審核作業流程

actor "送養者\n(一般會員/收容所會員)" as Reviewer
participant "auth.py\n(Blueprint)" as Auth
participant "applications.py\n(Blueprint)" as Applications
participant "animals.py\n(Blueprint)" as Animals
participant "application.py\n(Models)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py\n(Models)" as AnimalModel
participant "notification_service.py\n(Service)" as NotificationService
participant "email_tasks.py\n(Tasks)" as EmailTask
database "MySQL" as DB
queue "Redis\n(Celery)" as Redis

== 先決條件: 從申請列表選擇待審核申請 ==
note over Reviewer
    前置步驟: 使用者在「申請列表瀏覽」(GET /api/applications?mode=review)
    作業中選擇待審核申請 (status=PENDING)
end note

== 查看申請詳細資料 ==
Reviewer -> Applications: GET /api/applications/{application_id}
note right: Authorization: Bearer {token}

Applications -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證 JWT
Auth --> Applications: current_user_id

Applications -> DB: 查詢 Application\n(application_id, deleted_at=None)
DB --> Applications: Application 物件

Applications -> DB: 查詢 Animal\n(application.animal_id)
DB --> Applications: Animal 物件

Applications -> Applications: 檢查權限
note right
    權限檢查:
    1. 申請人本人 (applicant_id == current_user_id)
    2. 動物擁有者 (owner_id == current_user_id)
    3. 收容所成員 (shelter_id && primary_shelter_id)
    4. 管理員 (role == ADMIN)
end note

alt 無權限
    Applications --> Reviewer: 403 Forbidden\n「無權限查看此申請」
else 有權限
    Applications --> Reviewer: 返回申請詳細資料 (200)\n包含申請人資訊、動物資訊
end

== 送養者檢視申請內容與相關資料 ==
note over Reviewer
    送養者查看:
    - 申請人基本資料 (contact_phone, contact_address)
    - 申請人背景 (occupation, housing_type, has_experience)
    - 申請原因 (reason)
    - 其他備註 (notes)
    - 附件資料 (attachments)
end note

== 送養者進行審核評估與填寫審核意見 ==
note over Reviewer
    送養者評估後:
    - 選擇審核結果: 'approve' (核准) 或 'reject' (拒絕)
    - 填寫審核意見 (review_notes)
end note

== 提交審核結果 ==
Reviewer -> Applications: POST /api/applications/{application_id}/review\n{action: "approve/reject",\n review_notes: "審核意見"}

Applications -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證
Auth --> Applications: current_user_id

Applications -> DB: 查詢 User (current_user_id)
DB --> Applications: User 物件

Applications -> DB: 查詢 Application
DB --> Applications: Application 物件

Applications -> DB: 查詢 Animal (application.animal_id)
DB --> Applications: Animal 物件

Applications -> Applications: 檢查審核權限
note right
    <b>重要規則:</b>
    1. 管理員不能審核送養申請
    2. 只有送養人或收容所成員可審核
    
    個人送養: owner_id == current_user_id
    收容所動物: shelter_id && 
                role == SHELTER_MEMBER &&
                primary_shelter_id == animal.shelter_id
end note

alt 管理員嘗試審核
    Applications --> Reviewer: 403 Forbidden\n「領養申請應由送養人或\n收容所成員審核,\n管理員無權審核」
else 無權限
    Applications --> Reviewer: 403 Forbidden\n「只有送養人或收容所成員\n可以審核此申請」
else 申請狀態不是 PENDING/UNDER_REVIEW
    Applications --> Reviewer: 400 Bad Request\n「此申請無法審核」
else 有權限且狀態正確
    alt action == "approve" (核准)
        Applications -> ApplicationModel: 更新 status = APPROVED\nassignee_id = current_user_id\nreviewed_at = now()\nreview_notes\nversion++
        
        Applications -> AnimalModel: 更新動物狀態\nstatus = ADOPTED\nupdated_at = now()
        note right: <b>核准後動物不會在公開清單</b>
        
        Applications -> DB: db.session.commit()
        DB --> Applications: 確認
        
        Applications --> Reviewer: 200 OK\n「申請已核准」
        
    else action == "reject" (拒絕)
        Applications -> ApplicationModel: 更新 status = REJECTED\nassignee_id = current_user_id\nreviewed_at = now()\nreview_notes\nversion++
        
        Applications -> DB: db.session.commit()
        DB --> Applications: 確認
        
        Applications --> Reviewer: 200 OK\n「申請已拒絕」
    end
end

== 系統通知使用者審核結果 ==
Applications -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, reviewer_id,\nstatus, review_notes)

NotificationService -> DB: 建立 Notification 記錄\n(recipient_id = applicant_id,\n type = 'application_approved/rejected',\n actor_id = reviewer_id)
DB --> NotificationService: notification_id

NotificationService --> Applications: 通知已建立

== 發送審核結果 Email ==
Applications -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\nrecipient_email, animal_name,\nstatus, review_notes, contact_info)
note right
    contact_info 包含:
    - 個人送養: owner 的 name, email, phone
    - 收容所動物: shelter 的 name, email, phone
end note

EmailTask -> Redis: 加入 Celery 任務佇列
Redis --> EmailTask: task_id

EmailTask --> Applications: 任務已排程

note over Reviewer, Redis
    <b>後置條件:</b>
    - 申請狀態已更新 (APPROVED 或 REJECTED)
    - 申請人收到站內通知
    - 申請人收到 Email 通知 (包含送養人聯絡資訊)
    - 若核准: 動物狀態改為 ADOPTED,不再顯示在公開清單
    - 若拒絕: 動物維持原狀態,可供其他人申請
end note

@enduml